      "remediation": {
        "description": "Principal has an EC2-mediated escalation path. Its iam:PassRole grant reaches a role whose effective permissions exceed the principal's own, and its ec2:RunInstances grant allows it to launch an instance with that role as the instance profile. The instance's user-data or shell can read IMDS credentials for the role and perform any action the role is authorised for.",
        "action": "Scope iam:PassRole to a role whose effective permissions do not exceed the principal's, or remove ec2:RunInstances. If a broader instance-launch capability is required, enforce an instance-profile allowlist via a Condition on iam:PassRole (Condition.StringEquals: iam:PassedToService == ec2.amazonaws.com together with a narrowly-scoped Resource ARN).",
